  "notes": [
    "Page 2 (including the Total row and the certification block) is printed very faintly. In the Total row, the Amount Balance, \"Less than 30 days\" and \"3 years and above\" totals are only partly legible: the visible strokes read like \"530,539.36\", \"234,329.88\"/\"234,329.83\" and \"274,607.58\"/\"274,607.38\", where the faint digits are ambiguous between 3 and 8. They are recorded as null. The transcribed rows sum to 530,589.86 (Amount Balance), 234,329.88 (less than 30 days) and 274,607.58 (3 years and above), which is consistent with the faint figures if the ambiguous digits are 8s. The other column totals (3,952.40; 17,700.00; \"-\"; \"-\") are legible and match the rows.",
    "Each item row has the balance repeated in one aging column (a few rows also show stray \"-\" marks in other columns, kept as 0). Date Granted is printed as month-year and kept as text. Rows printed with \"-\" balances are kept as 0. \"Altizo, Cordelie P.\" and \"Jumamoy, Marina\" have no date printed.",
    "Long-outstanding balances that were in the \"Over 1 year\"/\"Over 2 years\" columns in earlier reports (e.g. Berame, Abegail; Marababol, Harlene; Matbagon, Jackson; Melancolico, Nelson) are now under \"3 years and above\"."
